@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
title UC14: Manage Brands and Menu Items - Activity Diagram
start
:Administrator authenticates into Platform Portal;
:Select Virtual Restaurant Brand management;
if (Manage Brand?) then (Brand Profile)
  :Create new brand profile or update existing profile;
  :Assign brand to authorized physical cloud kitchen hubs;
else (Menu Items)
  :Select specific brand menu catalog;
  :Add or modify menu item details (name, price, prep station, image);
  :Set station routing rules (Wok, Fryer, Assembly, Beverage);
  :Toggle hub-specific inventory availability;
endif
:System validates unique item codes and pricing constraints;
:Save changes and synchronize live catalog across hubs;
stop
@enduml
